                                            Return Req #${r.id.substring(0, 6)}
                                            <span class="bg-orange-100 text-orange-600 text-[10px] uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">Pending</span>
                                        </h4>
                                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Order #${r.order_uid} • ${r.user_name}</p>
